WEBVTT

01:04.920 --> 01:07.000
An object's value

01:07.080 --> 01:08.680
cannot be compared.

01:09.640 --> 01:12.400
It's value is not only based on the price,

01:12.480 --> 01:15.480
but also on a person's attachment to it.

01:15.560 --> 01:16.920
Can I see this one, please?

01:17.000 --> 01:18.120
That one there?

01:19.920 --> 01:20.960
Here you go.

01:22.600 --> 01:24.120
Small details…

01:24.200 --> 01:25.960
Neil Armstrong wore it, you know?

01:26.040 --> 01:28.760
…that make up some great story.

01:28.840 --> 01:30.560
It was made in the '60s.

01:32.080 --> 01:33.600
It was cheap then.

01:33.680 --> 01:35.520
It's a lot more expensive now, though.

01:36.640 --> 01:37.800
Oh.

01:38.720 --> 01:39.680
Thank you.

01:39.760 --> 01:41.520
I can give you a discount.

01:42.280 --> 01:43.560
Just for you.

01:44.800 --> 01:47.280
-I'll come back later. Good night.
-All right.

01:50.600 --> 01:52.880
But they all have the same value…

01:58.440 --> 01:59.960
once stolen.

02:28.120 --> 02:30.680
Meow, meow, meow. Here, kitty.
Meow, meow, meow.

04:18.960 --> 04:20.280
So the father isn't coming?

04:20.880 --> 04:22.800
My boss sent me on his behalf.

04:23.520 --> 04:25.200
He had a business trip abroad.

04:26.800 --> 04:28.080
This is TK,

04:28.760 --> 04:29.960
he's my boss's son.

04:31.360 --> 04:33.440
-Hello.
-Mm-hm. Welcome.

04:37.920 --> 04:39.920
He was expelled for stealing.

04:40.680 --> 04:41.560
KEMAWITTAYANUSORN SCHOOL

04:41.640 --> 04:42.800
It must have been serious.

04:44.880 --> 04:45.880
Hmm.

04:46.520 --> 04:48.320
Some of the reports were exaggerated.

04:50.280 --> 04:53.360
We don't accept students
with behavior issues here

04:53.880 --> 04:55.920
because we don't want any trouble
at our school.

04:56.920 --> 04:58.520
It causes lots of problems.

04:59.640 --> 05:00.720
He's aware of that.

05:00.800 --> 05:03.240
That's why he wanted to give you this.

05:08.080 --> 05:09.000
Ah.

05:10.400 --> 05:11.920
The school's maintenance fee.

05:12.000 --> 05:13.320
NARUECHIT LAORSRI
FIVE HUNDRED THOUSAND BAHT

05:13.400 --> 05:15.480
-We just a minute--
-And this right here…

05:23.960 --> 05:25.360
…is for you, my friend.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.720
A gift for you.

05:34.480 --> 05:37.040
Please tell him that our school is honored

05:37.120 --> 05:38.760
to have his son here.

05:39.880 --> 05:40.800
Yes.

05:47.320 --> 05:49.080
TK, you can go to class.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.400
I must be on my way.

06:11.160 --> 06:13.160
The survey that we conducted in class,

06:13.240 --> 06:15.880
examined the time interval
for each student

06:15.960 --> 06:18.040
to travel from their home to school,

06:18.120 --> 06:22.000
and how the time varies
depending on the method of travel.

06:22.080 --> 06:23.720
We saw that each one--

06:23.800 --> 06:24.920
-Excuse me, ma'am.
-Yeah?

06:29.240 --> 06:33.160
Ah, everyone, we have a new student.

06:35.400 --> 06:36.880
Introduce yourself.

06:37.800 --> 06:40.640
I'm Nanno. Good morning, everyone.

06:45.880 --> 06:47.200
Nice to meet you all.

06:48.680 --> 06:51.440
Great. Welcome to class.
You can sit right over there.

06:51.520 --> 06:52.440
Okay.

06:57.600 --> 06:59.680
Okay. Let's continue on.

07:00.720 --> 07:03.000
We saw that each person
took a different route.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.120
If you look over here,

07:05.200 --> 07:06.240
you see?

07:12.200 --> 07:13.160
Hey.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.560
What's up with that guy?

07:18.000 --> 07:20.960
If you're wondering about him,
his name is TK.

07:21.040 --> 07:22.680
He's new here, just like you are.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.520
Rumor has it

07:24.600 --> 07:28.160
he was expelled from his last school
for stealing.

07:29.960 --> 07:30.920
Huh.

07:31.680 --> 07:33.320
He doesn't look like a thief to me.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.760
Hmm, I don't know.

07:35.840 --> 07:38.960
What I do know is,
that thieves are the worst.

07:49.960 --> 07:51.160
-Hey, Nid.
-Yeah?

07:51.240 --> 07:52.880
Take Nanno to lunch with you.

07:52.960 --> 07:53.800
Of course.

07:57.240 --> 07:59.280
Hmm. Do you have my eraser?

08:49.840 --> 08:50.800
Here, take this.

08:59.800 --> 09:00.840
It's for you.

09:03.880 --> 09:05.000
Did you steal this too?

09:06.640 --> 09:07.600
You…

09:08.080 --> 09:09.720
are an interesting guy.

09:12.960 --> 09:13.960
Oh, am I?

09:14.840 --> 09:15.960
Do you think…

09:16.520 --> 09:18.680
I tell other people you're a thief?

09:22.560 --> 09:24.160
Why would I care, though?

09:24.960 --> 09:27.760
It's not like anyone
would listen to you anyway.

09:47.400 --> 09:48.520
Hey.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.840
Wanna go to the moon?

09:52.040 --> 09:53.400
Wow.

09:53.480 --> 09:54.640
Can I have that back?

10:01.040 --> 10:02.440
Let me tell you something.

10:03.640 --> 10:05.440
Your method of stealing

10:06.000 --> 10:08.880
is a little too risky.

10:10.360 --> 10:12.440
No wonder there's those rumors about you.

10:14.320 --> 10:15.320
Are you threatening me?

10:17.040 --> 10:19.920
Do you want to know
what it is that I stole?

10:23.160 --> 10:25.200
Why would I wanna know that?

10:33.080 --> 10:34.040
Here.

10:34.120 --> 10:35.640
KEMAWITTAYANUSORN SCHOOL

10:37.720 --> 10:38.920
Stealing from school

10:39.920 --> 10:42.160
is way more fun
than I thought it was gonna be.

10:45.520 --> 10:47.240
Shall we have a little competition then?

12:12.880 --> 12:16.840
Okay, so today we're going to look
at the results from the exam and see

12:16.920 --> 12:17.880
whether you…

12:46.160 --> 12:47.560
Wow, you are good at this.

12:48.560 --> 12:49.960
You believe me now?

12:52.200 --> 12:53.600
You ever been caught?

12:55.560 --> 12:57.560
No. I'm careful.

12:58.320 --> 12:59.240
How about you?

13:00.000 --> 13:01.480
No. Never.

13:01.560 --> 13:02.400
Liar.

13:02.480 --> 13:04.560
You aren't careful enough.

13:05.520 --> 13:06.680
But I can run.

13:08.840 --> 13:11.760
Hey! Stop right there! You're thieves!

13:11.840 --> 13:14.520
Come back! Hey!

13:20.200 --> 13:21.360
Nanno.

13:30.040 --> 13:31.600
Believe me now?

13:31.680 --> 13:32.640
Mm-hm.

13:37.040 --> 13:38.480
-Ooh. Ooh.
-Whoa.

14:00.440 --> 14:03.120
Oh!

14:45.040 --> 14:48.160
SHALL WE GO AGAIN TODAY?

14:59.920 --> 15:02.360
SURE. BUT NO MORE RUNNING. IT'S TIRING.

15:20.160 --> 15:22.560
CALL ME MASTER AND I'LL TEACH YOU.

15:26.280 --> 15:27.760
YOU ARE ALL TALK.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.880
-YOU FOX!
-AND YOU SUCK.

15:41.960 --> 15:44.120
-GHOST FACE.
-LET'S TRY SOMETHING HARDER.

15:49.800 --> 15:51.400
Listen up, everybody.

15:51.480 --> 15:53.240
What we did here
is gonna be your homework.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.920
Even though the principal sucks,

16:01.600 --> 16:03.200
he does have some good taste.

16:03.880 --> 16:05.280
I'll admit that.

16:08.160 --> 16:09.040
Mm-hm.

16:09.640 --> 16:11.440
There's security cameras in here?

16:12.600 --> 16:14.000
You should know that

16:14.520 --> 16:16.240
everyone has a weakness.

16:16.920 --> 16:18.520
We just gotta find his.

16:20.480 --> 16:21.560
Ah, see.

16:22.240 --> 16:24.200
This shows all the camera feeds in here.

16:25.880 --> 16:26.920
How did you do that?

16:27.520 --> 16:28.840
I just put in the password.

16:30.600 --> 16:32.360
-What's the password?
-Hey.

16:32.440 --> 16:34.040
I'm not gonna reveal

16:34.120 --> 16:35.840
all my secrets to you.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.480
Ah.

16:39.160 --> 16:40.600
That camera up there

16:41.600 --> 16:43.600
only covers

16:43.680 --> 16:44.920
this area right here.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.800
And this other camera

16:49.000 --> 16:50.800
only goes to there.

16:50.880 --> 16:53.160
So the blind spot is…

17:00.200 --> 17:03.760
I can't believe he paid so much money
for this painting.

17:21.880 --> 17:26.640
I think people pay more attention
to quantity than to detail.

17:28.520 --> 17:29.960
There's so many flowers.

17:35.680 --> 17:36.720
Attention.

17:36.800 --> 17:39.640
A painting has been stolen
from the art exhibition.

17:40.280 --> 17:43.440
A painting has been stolen
from the art exhibition.

17:44.840 --> 17:46.040
You all heard him.

17:46.120 --> 17:48.520
Bags on the table, right now.

17:49.560 --> 17:52.280
I'll personally go
through every single one of you.

18:06.240 --> 18:07.520
It was you, right?

18:25.200 --> 18:26.680
Are you helping your friend

18:27.240 --> 18:28.280
hide something?

18:45.480 --> 18:46.520
Isn't nice, huh?

18:47.440 --> 18:48.440
No way.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.840
I hate flowers.

18:56.240 --> 18:58.200
What are some other things
that you've stolen?

19:10.280 --> 19:11.600
Does this camera still work?

19:17.120 --> 19:19.760
Doesn't this cat belong
to that store owner?

19:19.840 --> 19:21.160
Well, it's my cat now.

19:21.240 --> 19:22.800
And these…

19:23.600 --> 19:26.600
Audrey Hepburn wore them
in Breakfast at Tiffany's.

19:28.480 --> 19:30.880
That one is from a store in Europe.

19:33.000 --> 19:35.480
Does that really belong
to Charlie Chaplin?

19:43.200 --> 19:46.240
This one is a limited edition.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.400
Ooh.

19:52.040 --> 19:53.120
And this diamond?

19:54.480 --> 19:56.560
I stole that from my last school.

20:02.080 --> 20:03.840
Where do you store all your stuff, then?

20:04.480 --> 20:05.600
Mm.

20:05.680 --> 20:07.360
In a warehouse that was stolen.

20:09.200 --> 20:10.280
No. I'm kidding.

20:12.200 --> 20:14.560
How about you?
Where do you keep your stuff?

20:15.120 --> 20:16.400
Hmm…

20:32.400 --> 20:33.680
Are you here alone?

20:53.000 --> 20:54.480
Hmm…

20:57.760 --> 20:59.400
You have a lot of stuff.

21:00.360 --> 21:01.800
That's quite impressive.

21:02.640 --> 21:03.840
Oh, come on.

21:03.920 --> 21:05.440
Your stuff fills a warehouse.

21:05.520 --> 21:06.440
Who is this?

21:08.600 --> 21:09.480
My father.

21:10.040 --> 21:11.160
And is he…

21:12.000 --> 21:13.040
Alive.

21:13.960 --> 21:14.960
But he…

21:16.360 --> 21:18.720
might as well be dead. He's never around.

21:21.800 --> 21:22.640
Hey, Nanno.

21:25.320 --> 21:26.640
Why do you steal stuff?

21:27.880 --> 21:29.160
I have no reason.

21:29.640 --> 21:30.480
I like it.

21:31.160 --> 21:32.440
It's a fun thing to do.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.800
What do you love to steal the most?

21:37.920 --> 21:38.760
Don't know.

21:40.760 --> 21:43.480
I take things that people say
are hard to steal.

21:44.720 --> 21:46.040
How about you?

21:50.480 --> 21:53.520
Hmm. I do it for fun as well.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.440
Wrong.

21:59.000 --> 22:02.200
You cannot be a good thief
unless you learn to lie, okay?

22:04.840 --> 22:06.120
And what does that mean?

22:14.120 --> 22:15.120
Nanno.

22:17.360 --> 22:20.800
Everyone says a genius
stole that painting.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.280
How was it genius?

22:23.880 --> 22:26.400
All I really did was look for the obvious.

22:33.320 --> 22:34.400
I want to thank you.

22:36.960 --> 22:38.120
What do you mean, "thank you"?

22:41.600 --> 22:44.160
For being a good friend.

22:47.880 --> 22:48.960
A friend?

22:51.560 --> 22:52.640
Mm-hm.

22:52.720 --> 22:53.840
I've…

22:53.920 --> 22:55.720
never had a friend before.

22:57.520 --> 22:59.920
Actually, I have no one.

23:14.320 --> 23:15.400
Well, listen--

23:15.480 --> 23:16.440
Do me a favor.

23:21.280 --> 23:22.840
Promise me that you won't leave.

23:27.280 --> 23:29.200
What makes you think I'll go away?

23:30.880 --> 23:31.880
Well, I…

23:32.400 --> 23:33.560
I have no idea.

23:34.160 --> 23:35.440
I just feel,

23:36.240 --> 23:38.440
like, maybe once

23:39.040 --> 23:40.760
you finished here or you're…

23:41.680 --> 23:43.440
done having fun, you'll leave.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.360
The thing is, I really…

23:51.280 --> 23:52.680
like being with you.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.560
Stay here with me.

24:02.160 --> 24:03.120
Mm-hm.

24:05.840 --> 24:06.840
Promise?

24:11.280 --> 24:13.240
Let's not make any promises.

24:15.160 --> 24:16.720
I mean, I'm here right now.

24:18.240 --> 24:20.560
Aren't I? I'm not going anywhere.

24:27.720 --> 24:30.680
We don't have to keep them for real.

24:32.040 --> 24:33.600
But they make us feel better.

24:37.520 --> 24:38.640
Well, I…

24:39.200 --> 24:40.680
think I like…

24:42.400 --> 24:43.600
being with

24:45.280 --> 24:46.320
you too.

24:49.960 --> 24:50.920
But I…

24:51.880 --> 24:52.960
But what's that?

24:53.640 --> 24:55.280
Please let go of my hand.

24:56.760 --> 24:57.760
Oh.

25:12.800 --> 25:15.000
I think that I can bring
your father back, TK.

25:20.960 --> 25:22.120
In the past,

25:23.120 --> 25:24.880
I always stole small things.

25:27.400 --> 25:29.680
Why don't we go for something bigger?

25:31.040 --> 25:32.520
What are you saying?

25:35.200 --> 25:38.120
Every year, new students enroll.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.960
And as you've experienced yourself,

25:40.480 --> 25:43.640
it's not very easy
to get into this school.

25:46.440 --> 25:49.800
Will you please help us out?
Please, Principal?

25:51.120 --> 25:52.520
He uses that money

25:52.600 --> 25:55.400
to fix up the school, right?

25:55.480 --> 25:57.720
But why don't we really think about it.

25:58.240 --> 25:59.760
Ever since you moved here,

26:00.480 --> 26:03.800
has anything really changed

26:04.280 --> 26:06.000
or improved at all?

26:06.080 --> 26:07.960
Apart from the principal

26:08.440 --> 26:11.160
who just gets richer,

26:12.160 --> 26:13.320
and richer?

26:14.520 --> 26:16.640
So you're going to steal his money, then?

26:17.320 --> 26:19.320
It isn't his money, you know.

26:20.000 --> 26:23.600
It's the money, you can say,
he stole from the students.

26:27.040 --> 26:28.400
Okay, so what's your plan?

26:30.000 --> 26:31.520
In his office,

26:32.680 --> 26:35.120
there's a poster right above his desk.

26:35.200 --> 26:36.800
And behind that poster,

26:36.880 --> 26:38.280
there is a hidden safe.

26:38.880 --> 26:40.800
We need to find a way to get it open.

26:40.880 --> 26:42.600
For this plan to work,

26:43.080 --> 26:44.520
we need to study up.

27:03.920 --> 27:05.760
The police have been following me all day.

27:12.720 --> 27:14.400
Shall we just give up the plan?

27:16.520 --> 27:18.560
I think our plan is very well crafted.

27:21.880 --> 27:23.400
But what if we get caught?

27:24.440 --> 27:26.040
What about that, Nanno?

27:28.040 --> 27:28.960
So, what then?

27:35.160 --> 27:36.160
It's okay.

27:36.880 --> 27:38.440
I can just go do it alone.

27:53.160 --> 27:55.480
-Hold on. Wait, Nanno.
-Leave me alone.

27:56.840 --> 27:58.320
We're not doing it now.

28:00.680 --> 28:03.320
I'm backing out of this for you.
I don't want…

28:04.280 --> 28:05.760
you to get caught.

28:07.080 --> 28:09.720
Yeah, well, I'm not afraid.
You can't stop me.

28:09.800 --> 28:10.800
Stop it.

28:13.800 --> 28:15.200
I'll do it. But…

28:16.840 --> 28:18.040
if you do get caught…

28:20.720 --> 28:21.960
blame everything on me.

28:23.840 --> 28:25.480
Tell them I was the one

28:26.640 --> 28:27.960
who talked you into it.

28:31.680 --> 28:33.400
-Why?
-What'd you say?

28:38.320 --> 28:40.920
What about the promise that we made?

28:46.400 --> 28:47.800
If it's about that then…

28:52.120 --> 28:53.520
I'll break it for you.

28:59.880 --> 29:01.160
So promise me.

29:03.240 --> 29:04.360
Promise me?

29:06.880 --> 29:08.200
Promise me, Nanno.

29:18.120 --> 29:19.960
We will go with the original plan.

30:08.120 --> 30:09.160
I'm ready, Nanno.

30:11.760 --> 30:13.640
Are you sure that you wanna go in alone?

30:15.520 --> 30:16.600
I'm sure.

30:17.480 --> 30:18.600
You go first.

30:23.840 --> 30:25.200
You're good to go.

30:49.600 --> 30:50.840
I found it, Nanno.

30:51.680 --> 30:53.760
-Hey, Nanno, keep an eye out.
-Yeah.

31:29.960 --> 31:31.480
I found the documents.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.560
Wait, let me talk to the kid alone.

32:00.640 --> 32:02.680
Please, can you give us some privacy?

32:02.760 --> 32:04.840
-Yes, sir. Go ahead.
-Okay. Thank you.

32:04.920 --> 32:06.200
Everyone, out.

32:16.880 --> 32:18.560
There is a way we can make this go away.

32:19.400 --> 32:22.720
Your father is a smart man and will know

32:24.440 --> 32:25.760
the best way to handle this.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.560
I've already told him

32:28.960 --> 32:30.880
all about what you've been
up to here tonight.

32:46.440 --> 32:49.880
You can't steal my father's money
this time, understand?

32:51.440 --> 32:53.440
Even though I don't have
the documents anymore…

32:55.560 --> 32:58.040
I have the footage from your cameras.

32:59.280 --> 33:01.160
Imagine if it got out.

33:06.120 --> 33:07.760
She didn't do anything.

33:07.840 --> 33:08.960
Actually,

33:09.640 --> 33:12.240
she has everything to do with this.

33:17.440 --> 33:19.080
All the footage

33:19.960 --> 33:21.640
was saved on this computer.

33:27.960 --> 33:29.320
She…

33:30.080 --> 33:32.120
deserves to be here at our school.

33:36.720 --> 33:38.920
Principal,
there's a parent here to see you.

33:39.400 --> 33:40.560
Then let him in.

33:43.360 --> 33:45.840
I think that I can bring
your father back, TK.

33:49.920 --> 33:51.320
Hmm.

33:58.640 --> 33:59.680
I know…

34:01.640 --> 34:03.400
some unruly behavior occurred.

34:03.480 --> 34:04.360
Mm.

34:05.040 --> 34:07.240
And that's why my boss
has a small gift for you

34:08.320 --> 34:10.240
to make up for all the troubles
you went through.

34:13.680 --> 34:15.280
He will also gladly

34:16.520 --> 34:17.680
pay back

34:18.840 --> 34:20.840
for any of the damage
of this school's property.

34:22.880 --> 34:24.880
NARUECHIT LAORSRI

34:31.520 --> 34:32.960
You tell my dad

34:34.080 --> 34:35.160
that money

34:36.360 --> 34:37.920
can't fix everything.

34:41.960 --> 34:44.840
-I won't be seeing you again.
-Don't you dare do that!

34:48.760 --> 34:50.720
-Will you please calm down.
-Are you okay?

34:50.800 --> 34:52.880
-Why should I?
-Officers, take him away.

36:06.440 --> 36:08.440
YOUTH DETENTION CENTER

36:22.400 --> 36:24.360
I don't wanna see you here again.

36:51.720 --> 36:54.320
Are you that surprised
to see your own father?

36:57.440 --> 36:58.440
Why are you here?

36:59.520 --> 37:02.600
You're mean, just like your mother.

37:05.640 --> 37:07.120
I don't want you here.

37:08.200 --> 37:09.640
I don't want your money.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.160
I can survive all by myself.

37:16.400 --> 37:18.120
Well, I was just stopping by.

37:19.080 --> 37:22.160
I'll leave soon. Son, are you okay?

37:39.280 --> 37:40.680
Well, then. Take care, son.

37:57.800 --> 37:58.760
Dad!

39:48.120 --> 39:49.640
You know what our problem is?

39:50.360 --> 39:52.960
We don't really appreciate what we have

39:53.840 --> 39:55.320
until it's all gone.

